&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with standard application security compliance and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of fault detection, RCA (Root Cause Analysis), and structured resolution processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Amazon Web Services (AWS) — core services for compute, storage, networking, and monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Technical Skills – Deep Knowledge in at Least One of:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
